OL,3,GNEWSAAndy Burnham joins tributes to
OL,4,A'giant' of Manchester politics
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister has paid tribute to
OL,7,F"a giant" of Manchester's political
OL,8,Fscene, Pat Karney, after his death at
OL,9,Fthe age of 78, saying he was a
OL,10,F"tireless champion for the people he
OL,11,Frepresented".
OL,13,FKarney had represented Harpurhey for
OL,14,FLabour since 1979 and had been
OL,15,Fwell-known as the council's city centre
OL,16,Fspokesman.
OL,18,FHe had been suffering from cancer and
OL,19,Fhad been having treatment at The
OL,20,FChristie hospital.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
