OL,3,GNEWSAAndy Burnham joins tributes to
OL,4,A'giant' of Manchester politics
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham said he was
OL,7,F"deeply saddened" by Karney's death and
OL,8,Fhe would "miss him greatly".
